# Read-only Kalshi market data needs NO authentication, so the paper harness and
# `kwt live-mm --mode dry_run` work out of the box with these UNSET.
#
# Set these to run LIVE order placement (`kwt live-mm --mode demo|prod`). Generate
# an API key in the Kalshi web app (Account -> API) and download the RSA private
# key. Keep the .pem OUTSIDE this repo with tight permissions (chmod 600); never
# commit it, and never put it in config/ or the database.
# KALSHI_API_KEY_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
# KALSHI_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=/absolute/path/to/kalshi_private_key.pem
